Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lecture Slides",
  "description": "Updated slides for this module.",
  "type": 1,
  "data": "https://example.com/slides-v2.pdf"
}

### Modules - Patch Resource
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/modules/{{moduleId}}/resources/{{resourceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json-patch+json

[
  { "op": "replace", "path": "/description", "value": "Patched module resource description." }
