### Modules - Remove Resource
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/modules/{{moduleId}}/resources/{{resourceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Accept: application/json


# =====================================================================
# ACTIVITIES  (ActivitiesController - api/modules/{moduleId}/activities)
# Reads require any authenticated user; writes require role: Teacher or Admin
# ActivityType: 0=Lecture, 1=SelfStudy, 2=Exercise, 3=Assignment, 4=Review
# =====================================================================

### Activities - Get All
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/modules/{{moduleId}}/activities?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Activities - Get One
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/modules/{{moduleId}}/activities/{{activityId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Activities - Create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/modules/{{moduleId}}/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kickoff Lecture",
  "description": "Introductory lecture for the module.",
  "startOffset": 0,
  "duration": 60,
  "type": 0
}

### Activities - Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/modules/{{moduleId}}/activities/{{activityId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kickoff Lecture",
  "description": "Introductory lecture for the module.",
  "startOffset": 0,
  "duration": 90,
  "type": 0
}

### Activities - Patch
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/modules/{{moduleId}}/activities/{{activityId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json-patch+json

[
  { "op": "replace", "path": "/duration", "value": 45 }
]

### Activities - Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/modules/{{moduleId}}/activities/{{activityId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Activities - Get Resources
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/modules/{{moduleId}}/activities/{{activityId}}/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
