### Activities - Get Resource
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/modules/{{moduleId}}/activities/{{activityId}}/resources/{{resourceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Activities - Create Resource
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/modules/{{moduleId}}/activities/{{activityId}}/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
