{
  "name": "Activity Handout",
  "description": "Handout for this activity.",
  "type": 1,
  "data": "https://example.com/handout.pdf"
}

### Activities - Attach Existing Resource
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/modules/{{moduleId}}/activities/{{activityId}}/resources/{{resourceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Activities - Update Resource
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/modules/{{moduleId}}/activities/{{activityId}}/resources/{{resourceId}}
