# =====================================================================
# RESOURCES  (ResourcesController - api/resources)
# All actions require an authenticated user; modifying another user's
# resource additionally requires role: Admin
# ResourceType: 0=Text, 1=URL, 2=AssignmentTurnin, 3=ExternalFile
# =====================================================================

### Resources - Get All
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/resources?type=1
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Resources - Get One
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/resources/{{resourceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Resources - Create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Reading List",
  "description": "Recommended reading for the course.",
  "type": 1,
  "data": "https://example.com/reading-list"
}

### Resources - Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/resources/{{resourceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Reading List",
  "description": "Updated recommended reading for the course.",
  "type": 1,
  "data": "https://example.com/reading-list-v2"
}

### Resources - Patch
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/resources/{{resourceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json-patch+json

[
  { "op": "replace", "path": "/description", "value": "Patched resource description." }
]

### Resources - Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/resources/{{resourceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Accept: application/json
